      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAYS WHO (6) made a promising debut when hitting the frame, finishing second (17.80) at this track over 300m. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. TRAVEL BUDDY (7) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 300m behind Velvet And Black (18.07) in a Maiden. Placed at his previous run. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Great chance to atone. SIDE CHANCE (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (17.99) in a Maiden at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Good beginner and aided by a handy draw. Key player on best and worth another try. MAGIC SUGAR (8) makes debut for the Jacqueline Davis kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Profiles nicely but market best guide to ability.",
